  CameraIcon, Zap, Mic2, Mic, Package, Cpu, Award, Target, Layers, Filter, Gauge, 
  Gem, Crown, Star, Sparkles, Activity, BarChart3, PieChart, LineChart,
  Wallet, Coins, TrendingDown, Calculator, Receipt, CreditCard as CardIcon,
  ShieldCheck, FileBarChart, Building2, Globe, Banknote, ChevronDown, MessageCircle, ChevronRight, Minus, CheckSquare, MessageSquare,
  UserPlus, User, Building, Key, X, UserCheck, Heart, Edit3, FolderOpen, Share2, Share, Cloud, Instagram, Facebook, Lightbulb, Save
